ax-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Let's examine our statement:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The word \"each\" indicates that we use a universal quantifier, <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.939ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 835 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\forall.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2200\" d=\"M0 673Q0 684 7 689T20 694Q32 694 38 680T82 567L126 451H430L473 566Q483 593 494 622T512 668T519 685Q524 694 538 694Q556 692 556 674Q556 670 426 329T293 -15Q288 -22 278 -22T263 -15Q260 -11 131 328T0 673ZM414 410Q414 411 278 411T142 410L278 55L414 410Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2200\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"556\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The words \"there is\" indicate that we use an existential quantifier, <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.939ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 835 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\exists.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2203\" d=\"M56 661T56 674T70 694H487Q497 686 500 679